WEBVTT

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.238
A: Well, it's a snare
that every sensible man

00:02:00.262 --> 00:02:02.283
would like to be caught in, and ...

00:02:02.982 --> 00:02:04.402
Jo Michael Rezes: (Sighs)

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.184
I'm so sorry, I um --

00:02:11.053 --> 00:02:13.259
I didn't finish rehearsing.

00:02:14.104 --> 00:02:17.028
Um, well it's not because
I can't walk in heels,

00:02:17.052 --> 00:02:18.635
I'm actually really good at that,

00:02:18.659 --> 00:02:21.492
and I can prove it to you, too,
but I really am sorry.

00:02:21.516 --> 00:02:22.881
Hold on.

00:02:24.993 --> 00:02:26.445
Uh, um.

00:02:29.255 --> 00:02:30.405
No matter.